  <reporting-org ref="XI-IATI-IADB" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inter-American Development Bank</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Family Ministry Strengthening</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecimiento Ministerio de la Familia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Los objetivos del proyecto incluyen: (i) fortalecer el marco normativo y operativo para atender las necesidades de grupos en situacin de vulnerabilidad y riesgo social; (ii) incrementar la capacidad institucional del MIFAMILIA para la rectora de las polticas de proteccin social; (iii) fortalecer la oferta privada de servicios de proteccin; y (iv) fortalecer la articulacin intersectorial con gobiernos locales, instituciones y organismos privados que brindan servicios de proteccin social.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the project include: (i) to strengthen the normative and operational framework for attending the needs of vulnerable or at risk groups; (ii) to increase the institutional capacity of MIFAMILIA as the principal government authority on social protection policies; (iii) to strengthen the supply of private sector social protection services; and (iv) to strengthen the inter-sectorial coordination among local governments, institutions, and private organizations that provide social protection services.</narrative>
  </description>
